{"v":4,"catch":"神祕面具之下，是驅邪儀式，還是連環殺人的舞台？","desc":"這是一款融合了中國鄉村宗教儀式與謀殺懸疑的敘事遊戲。當民間信仰和現代恐怖相碰撞，你能揭示面具背後的真相嗎？\n\n豐富而完整的故事篇幅，像一部互動小說的冒險。多元的互動選擇與支線故事，最終走向不同的故事結局。\n\n調查玩法需要你不斷蒐集碎片訊息，體驗緊張刺激的搜索指證過程，一步一步破解這個謎！","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2025-08-28","genres":["角色扮演","冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7996480e492f4d6afd4b1012981fbf84fefa9a11001dbf37b1fcbc22565869f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82a6856fa1e1929c95a5de9e6ba0e865ce00a2378c1219c169e03a4f9a43328a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea7ae68d539cf15fe946b4a8e622016a4c85f6884cbd6fd2c4ee8ce8195ce0bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbd1ff9d894b69d21923c71be7d28b10c1ad16df15e9cd111ce0b36b72673923.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/76fe63774b3b2820aa097c459b612e6095afa21ecc8921b9dc198327f73cec5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2443bb10fa37c36dc9e6d1d4ac47986736e6aae73a573201bae00616e470432a.jpg"],"titleId":"010030b0235d8000","dlc":[]}